# Molten Man, Inferno Incarnate (0/0): "When Molten Man enters, search your library for a basic Mountain card, put it onto the battlefield
# tapped, then shuffle", "Molten Man gets +1/+1 for each Mountain you control" and "When Molten Man leaves the battlefield, sacrifice a land."
# Bot1 has a Mountain already, so the 0/0 survives until its trigger fetches the library's only Mountain, tapped (a Forest and a Blasted
# Landscape stay, and so does Bot2's Mountain in its own library): two Mountains make him 2/2, and Bot2's Mountain on the battlefield does not
# count. Bot1 then plays Swamp and kills him with Flame Slash (4 damage); the leaves trigger makes Bot1 sacrifice a land of their choice, the
# Swamp, so both Mountains stay.

